"如果一切顺利"}]},{"id":"well:o:d6ac48518fdb","label":"adj.","definitionZh":"可取的","glossesEn":["advisable"],"examples":[{"english":"it would be just as well to check","chinese":"最好还是核实一下"},{"english":"it might be just as well to telephone","chinese":"不妨打个电话"}]},{"id":"well:o:6544d955f464","label":"adj.","definitionZh":"幸运的","glossesEn":["fortunate"],"examples":[{"english":"it was just as well for him that the shops were still open","chinese":"他还算幸运，商店还开着"},{"english":"it's just as well you're not hungry, because …","chinese":"幸好你不饿，因为…"},{"english":"the flight was delayed, which was just as well","chinese":"幸亏航班推迟了"}]},{"id":"well:o:00bfb790ecde","label":"adv.","definitionZh":"好","glossesEn":["satisfactorily"],"examples":[{"english":"to work/sleep well","chinese":"工作好/睡得好"},{"english":"he isn't eating very well","chinese":"他胃口不好"},{"english":"these scissors cut well","chinese":"这把剪刀好使"}]},{"id":"well:o:611e098f3a87","label":"adv.","definitionZh":"顺利地","glossesEn":["successfully"],"examples":[{"english":"to go well","chinese":"进展顺利"},{"english":"if all goes well …","chinese":"如果一切顺利…"},{"english":"to work well","chinese":"运行顺利"}]},{"id":"well:o:412ef440f44b","label":"adv.","definitionZh":"有利地","glossesEn":["profitably"],"examples":[{"english":"to do quite well out of the war","chinese":"大发战争财"},{"english":"to do well for oneself","chinese":"致富"},{"english":"to do oneself well","chinese":"养尊处优"}]},{"id":"well:o:8acdc0f24a91","label":"adv.","definitionZh":"合适地","glossesEn":["appropriately"],"examples":[{"english":"to be well judged/matched","chinese":"判断很准确/很相配"},{"english":"to do well to do sth","chinese":"做某事很明智"},{"english":"he would do well to remember that …","chinese":"他最好记住…"}]},{"id":"well:o:5992d4c0911e","label":"adv.","definitionZh":"善意地","glossesEn":["kindly"],"examples":[{"english":"to treat sb well","chinese":"对某人友善"},{"english":"to do well by sb","chinese":"对某人很慷慨"}]},{"id":"well:o:00eee8ef3668","label":"adv.","definitionZh":"赞成地","glossesEn":["favourably"],"examples":[{"english":"to speak/think well of sb/sth","chinese":"对某人/某事说好话/评价高"},{"english":"to be well received/regarded","chinese":"受到好评/赞赏"}]},{"id":"well:o:3df09b6c49af","label":"adv.","definitionZh":"平静地","glossesEn":["with equanimity"],"examples":[{"english":"to take sth well","chinese":"平静地接受某事物"},{"english":"to respond well to sth","chinese":"对某事物反应平静"}]},{"id":"well:o:46a64fd16910","label":"adv.","definitionZh":"完全地","glossesEn":["completely"],"examples":[{"english":"to mix well","chinese":"充分搅拌"},{"english":"‘shake well’","chinese":"“摇匀”"}]},{"id":"well:o:75dea9be6e74","label":"adv.","definitionZh":"彻底地","glossesEn":["to high degree"],"examples":[{"english":"to know sth/sb well","chinese":"十分了解某事物/某人"},{"english":"he’s well able to take care of himself","chinese":"他完全能够自理"},{"english":"to be well worth seeing","chinese":"很值得一看"}]},{"id":"well:o:efbb554a2285","label":"adv.","definitionZh":"远远地","glossesEn":["by a large amount"],"examples":[{"english":"to be well above/below average","chinese":"远远高于/低于平均数"},{"english":"to be well over thirty/100 years old","chinese":"远不止30/100岁"},{"english":"to be well back from the road","chinese":"远离公路"}]},{"id":"well:o:6688f99090ef","label":"adv.","definitionZh":"很可能","glossesEn":["probably"],"examples":[{"english":"you may (very) well be right","chinese":"你很可能是对的"},{"english":"it may well be that …","chinese":"很可能…"}]},{"id":"well:o:1b837b02bb51","label":"adv.","definitionZh":"轻易地","glossesEn":["easily"],"examples":[{"english":"she can well afford to pay for it","chinese":"她完全买得起"},{"english":"I can well believe it!","chinese":"这事我并不觉得意外！"}]},{"id":"well:o:11b86c51ebfb","label":"adv.","definitionZh":"应该","glossesEn":["with good reason"],"examples":[{"english":"I can’t very well leave now","chinese":"我现在离开不太合适"},{"english":"she looked shocked, as well she might","chinese":"她看上去很震惊，这是理所当然的"},{"english":"how did he get in? — you may well ask!","chinese":"他是怎么进去的？──你问得好！"}]},{"id":"well:o:92a67da3a19b","label":"adv.","definitionZh":"表示最好做某事","glossesEn":["as best course of action"],"examples":[{"english":"we may as well go home","chinese":"我们还是回家的好"},{"english":"we might just as well have stayed at home","chinese":"我们当初还不如待在家里"},{"english":"shall I shut the door? — you might as well","chinese":"我把门关上好吗？──你不妨关上吧"}]},{"id":"well:o:41d74b6e5852","label":"adv.","definitionZh":"非常","glossesEn":["very"],"registers":["informal","British"],"examples":[{"english":"it was well good or well bad!","chinese":"太好了！"}]},{"id":"well:o:cfe8aa0efc66","label":"int.","definitionZh":"表示惊奇、愤怒","glossesEn":["expressing surprise, anger"],"examples":[{"english":"well, really!","chinese":"啊，真是的！"},{"english":"well, who would have thought it!","chinese":"哎呀，谁会想到那儿去呢！"},{"english":"well I never, look who's here!","chinese":"天哪，看看谁在这儿呀！"}]},{"id":"well:o:0930351cc5ea","label":"int.","definitionZh":"表示宽慰、让步","glossesEn":["expressing relief, resignation"],"examples":[{"english":"well, thank goodness that's over!","chinese":"好啦，谢天谢地，这事总算过去了！"},{"english":"well, that's too bad","chinese":"唉，太倒霉了"},{"english":"oh well, there's nothing I can do about it","chinese":"算啦，我对此事毫无办法"}]},{"id":"well:o:7d09f043b5b2","label":"int.","definitionZh":"表示不肯定、不感兴趣","glossesEn":["expressing uncertainty, dismissiveness"],"examples":[{"english":"well, I think so","chinese":"哦，我想是吧"},{"english":"she called me a fool — well, so what?","chinese":"她叫我傻子──哦，那又怎么样？"}]},{"id":"well:o:ab8f763e797e","label":"int.","definitionZh":"表示勉强同意","glossesEn":["expressing reluctant agreement"],"examples":[{"english":"well, you may be right","chinese":"好吧，可能你是对的"},{"english":"well, you have a point, but …","chinese":"是啊，你有道理，但是…"}]},{"id":"well:o:4eab1610f49a","label":"int.","definitionZh":"表示停顿","glossesEn":["after pause, continuing thought, in conclusion"],"examples":[{"english":"well, as I was saying, …","chinese":"嗯，正如我刚才说的，…"},{"english":"he said he'd kill himself — well, did he?","chinese":"他说他要自杀──那么他自杀了吗？"},{"english":"well then, what's the problem?","chinese":"那么，问题出在什么地方呢？"}]},{"id":"well:o:c12d547d6706","label":"int.","definitionZh":"表示更正刚说过的话","glossesEn":["modifying statement"],"examples":[{"english":"she is four, well, four and a half to be precise","chinese":"她4个月，对了，准确地说，是4个半月大"}]},{"id":"well:o:15170d08ad5f","label":"int.","definitionZh":"表示结束交谈","glossesEn":["marking end"],"examples":[{"english":"well, I’d better be going now","chinese":"就这样，我现在该走了"}]},{"id":"well:o:fdcc96623827","label":"adv. phr.","definitionZh":"也","examples":[{"english":"is he coming as well?","chinese":"他也来吗？"},{"english":"you know as well as I do …","chinese":"你和我一样清楚…"},{"english":"he already had four dogs, and now he has two cats as well","chinese":"他已经有4条狗了，现在又有了两只猫"}]},{"id":"well:o:cf45a05d7a66","label":"prep. phr.","definitionZh":"除…之外","examples":[{"english":"to work on Saturday as well as on Sunday","chinese":"星期天和星期六都工作"},{"english":"by day as well as by night","chinese":"在白天和黑夜"}]},{"id":"well:o:cb59e06ebc70","label":"conj. phr.","definitionZh":"除…之外","examples":[{"english":"you know as well as I do","chinese":"你我都知道"},{"english":"to run a business as well as bringing up four children","chinese":"不仅抚养4个孩子，而且还经营一家公司"}]},{"id":"well:o:77708a999a71","label":"n.","definitionZh":"水井","glossesEn":["for water"],"examples":[{"english":"to dig/drill/sink a well","chinese":"挖井/钻井/掘井"}]},{"id":"well:o:d0408c1b0d8d","label":"n.","definitionZh":"油井","glossesEn":["for oil"]},{"id":"well:o:5803b7bbe85c","label":"n.","definitionZh":"气井","glossesEn":["for gas"]},{"id":"well:o:88fff13bbd11","label":"n.","definitionZh":"升降机井","glossesEn":["for lift"]},{"id":"well:o:561cfe26fde3","label":"n.","definitionZh":"楼梯通风井","glossesEn":["for stairs"]},{"id":"well:o:ceefae7b70cc","label":"n.","definitionZh":"通风采光井","glossesEn":["for light, air"]},{"id":"well:o:1b5fb401671b","label":"n.","definitionZh":"工作人员席","registers":["British"],"domains":["Law"]},{"id":"well:o:23d88693bd89","label":"n.","definitionZh":"墨水槽","glossesEn":["for ink"]},{"id":"well:o:1f1c610ac8fc","label":"n.","definitionZh":"凹槽","glossesEn":["depression"]},{"id":"well:o:a75365728426","label":"n.","definitionZh":"源泉","glossesEn":["source"],"registers":["figurative"],"examples":[{"english":"to be a well of information about sth","chinese":"对某事如数家珍"}]}]}}}